      "body": "Stacked on NVIDIA/Megatron-LM#7500.\n\n## Summary\n- Compute no-grad CSA2 indexer scores in key chunks (`_chunked_csa2_indexer_scores`), so the full per-head score tensor is never materialized at once.\n- Allow selective recompute with CSA2 as long as no attention modules (`core_attn`, `gdn_norm_out`, `gdp_qkv`, `gdp_in_proj`, `shortcut_pre_mlp_layernorm`) are recomputed. Full recompute is still rejected because it would re-publish cross-layer KV.\n- Recompute single-pass mHC mappings instead of keeping their activations.",
      "changedFiles": 6,
