    {
      "body": "@guihong-nv This is a follow-up PR on top of #7500. It reduces memory by chunking the no-grad CSA2 indexer scoring and recomputing the single-pass mHC mappings, and it allows selective recompute with CSA2 when no attention modules are recomputed. Verified together with https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/pull/6199. Please let me know if you have any comments.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T22:37:03Z",
